[
  {
    "id": 11,
    "title": "为什么需要 10 类 Content Type？",
    "content": "<h2>同一套流程骨架，如何适配不同内容类型？</h2>\n\n<div class='problem-card'>\n  <div class='card-label'>痛点</div>\n  <p>研发流程、创意流程、企业传播流程——对<span class='term'>Content Type<span class='tip'>内容类型</span></span>的要求截然不同：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>谁来决策？</li>\n    <li>门禁是什么？</li>\n    <li>最终产出什么？</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>用同一套逻辑处理，必然导致<span class='highlight'>过松或过严</span>。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class='solution-card'>\n  <div class='card-label'>解法：Profile 装配系统</div>\n  <p>按 <strong>contentType × riskClass</strong> 装配：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>角色（决策者、审核者）</li>\n    <li>Rubric（评判标准）</li>\n    <li>门禁（<span class='term'>Gate<span class='tip'>门禁规则</span></span>）</li>\n    <li>产物（输出格式与模板）</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class='domain-grid'>\n  <div class='domain dev'>\n    <div class='domain-label'>研发</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><span class='term'>Spec<span class='tip'>技术规格</span></span>（技术规格）</li>\n      <li><span class='term'>ADR<span class='tip'>选型决策记录</span></span>（选型决策）</li>\n      <li><span class='term'>Plan<span class='tip'>交付计划</span></span>（交付计划）</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class='domain creative'>\n    <div class='domain-label'>创意</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><span class='term'>Creative Brief<span class='tip'>创意简报</span></span>（创意简报）</li>\n      <li><span class='term'>Enablement<span class='tip'>知识赋能</span></span>（知识库）</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class='domain enterprise'>\n    <div class='domain-label'>企业市场</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><span class='term'>External Comms<span class='tip'>对外材料</span></span>（对外材料）</li>\n      <li><span class='term'>Analytics<span class='tip'>分析报告</span></span>（分析报告）</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "notes": "强调 Profile 装配的核心价值：让同一套流程骨架在不同领域自动适配正确的规则。三个领域的示例帮助听众建立直觉——他们的工作属于哪一类。下一张进入总览。"
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "title": "内容类型总览（10 类）",
    "content": "<h2>10 类 Content Type 一览</h2>\n\n<div class='type-grid'>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Spec</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>schema + examples 合同，breaking change 迁移窗口</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>ADR</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>trade-offs + revisit triggers + 拒绝理由</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Plan</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>阶段门禁 + 并行资格机读裁决</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>QA/Audit</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>evidence manifest + 默认脱敏</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Ops</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>Execution Intent + Danger Zone token</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Security</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>controls→gate + restricted 指针</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Analytics</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>metricVersion + query pointers</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Comms</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>claim→evidence + 审批块</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Creative</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>Brief 必填 + Do-Not</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='type-card'>\n    <div class='type-name'>Enablement</div>\n    <div class='type-gate'>双轨结构 + 命令标签</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='legend'>\n  <div class='legend-item'><span class='dot tech'></span>技术治理类</div>\n  <div class='legend-item'><span class='dot ops'></span>运维安全类</div>\n  <div class='legend-item'><span class='dot biz'></span>业务传播类</div>\n</div>",
    "notes": "总览页，快速建立全局认知。10 类按领域分组（技术/运维/业务），核心门禁一句话概括。后续 4 张分页深入 Spec、Comms、Ops 三类典型场景。"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "title": "对外材料（External Comms）— 审批链路",
    "content": "<h2>对外承诺必须可追溯</h2>\n\n<div class='critical-callout'>\n  <span class='icon'>⚠</span>\n  <div>\n    <div class='callout-title'>为什么关键？</div>\n    <p>对外发布的声明、数据、承诺——任何失误都将影响<span class='highlight'>客户信任与法律责任</span>。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='required-fields'>\n  <div class='field-group'>\n    <div class='field-label'>claim→evidence 映射表</div>\n    <p>每个声明<span class='highlight'>必须有对应证据指针</span>，不可空口无凭。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='field-group'>\n    <div class='field-label'>审批块（必填）</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Approvers（审批人）</li>\n      <li>Date（日期）</li>\n      <li>Expiry（有效期）</li>\n      <li>Scope（适用范围）</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class='field-group'>\n    <div class='field-label'>Migration / Rollback</div>\n    <p>承诺内容变更时的<span class='highlight'>迁移与回滚策略</span>。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='fail-closed'>\n  <div class='fail-label'>FAIL-CLOSED</div>\n  <div class='fail-conditions'>\n    <div class='condition fail'>缺 Approvers / Expiry / Scope</div>\n    <div class='arrow'>→</div>\n    <div class='result fail'>BLOCK</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='condition fail'>未批准承诺</div>\n  <div class='arrow'>→</div>\n  <div class='result fail'>直接阻断</div>\n</div>",
    "notes": "External Comms 是企业中风险最高的类型之一——直接与外部接触。fail-closed 设计确保没有审批链路的材料无法流出。强调 claim→evidence 映射是核心，也是最容易被忽视的部分。"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "title": "运维/事故（Ops/Incident）— 危险操作门禁",
    "content": "<h2>Execution Intent：操作的安全水位线</h2>\n\n<div class='intent-grid'>\n  <div class='intent-card safe'>\n    <div class='intent-label'>NONE</div>\n    <div class='intent-desc'>仅读取，不执行</div>\n    <div class='intent-status'>安全</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='intent-card caution'>\n    <div class='intent-label'>READ-ONLY</div>\n    <div class='intent-desc'>仅查询操作</div>\n    <div class='intent-status'>需审核</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='intent-card danger'>\n    <div class='intent-label'>WRITE</div>\n    <div class='intent-desc'>写操作 — 必须带 token</div>\n    <div class='intent-status'>高风险</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='danger-zone'>\n  <div class='zone-header'><span class='zone-icon'>☠</span> Danger Zone — 写操作必须包含以下全部</div>\n  <div class='zone-requirements'>\n    <div class='zone-item'>\n      <span class='check'>✓</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class='req-title'>影响面分析</div>\n        <div class='req-desc'>操作影响范围与受影响系统列表</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='zone-item'>\n      <span class='check'>✓</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class='req-title'>回滚策略</div>\n        <div class='req-desc'>如果失败，如何恢复到操作前状态</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='zone-item'>\n      <span class='check'>✓</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class='req-title'>前置检查清单</div>\n        <div class='req-desc'>执行前必须确认的条件</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='zone-item'>\n      <span class='check'>✓</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class='req-title'>验证步骤</div>\n        <div class='req-desc'>操作完成后如何确认成功</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='zone-item'>\n      <span class='check'>✓</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class='req-title'>授权 Token</div>\n        <div class='req-desc'>带签名的危险操作授权凭证</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "notes": "Ops 场景中最容易出事故的就是没有明确 Execution Intent 的操作。通过三级水位线（NONE/READ-ONLY/WRITE），让每条操作指令自带风险标签。Danger Zone 的五项要求是防止运维事故的硬性防线。"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "title": "Spec（技术规格）— 合同化治理",
    "content": "<h2>schema + examples = 可回归合同</h2>\n\n<div class='contract-visual'>\n  <div class='contract-left'>\n    <div class='contract-title'>规范（Spec）</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>schema 定义</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>examples 示例</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>strict / compat 分级</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='contract-equals'>=</div>\n  <div class='contract-right'>\n    <div class='contract-title'>可回归合同</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>接口契约</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>测试用例</div>\n    <div class='contract-item'>破坏性变更追踪</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='spec-levels'>\n  <div class='level strict'>\n    <div class='level-label'>strict</div>\n    <div class='level-desc'>高风险类技术规格，强制严格模式</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='level compat'>\n    <div class='level-label'>compat</div>\n    <div class='level-desc'>向后兼容，允许渐进迁移</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='fail-closed spec-fail'>\n  <div class='fail-label'>FAIL-CLOSED 规则</div>\n  <div class='fail-list'>\n    <div class='fail-item'><span class='x'>✕</span> 缺 schema / examples → <span class='block-tag'>BLOCK</span></div>\n    <div class='fail-item'><span class='x'>✕</span> breaking change 无迁移策略 → <span class='block-tag'>BLOCK</span></div>\n    <div class='fail-item'><span class='x'>✕</span> 示例命中敏感模式（token / key / 绝对路径） → <span class='block-tag'>BLOCK</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='profile-note'>\n  <span class='profile-icon'>⚙</span>\n  <div><strong>Profile 装配：</strong>高风险类技术规格（支付、认证、数据格式）→ <span class='highlight'>strict 模式强制</span>，不允许 compat 回退。</div>\n</div>",
    "notes": "Spec 是技术治理的基石。schema + examples 作为合同的核心思想：让机器可读、可回归。strict/compat 分级平衡了安全性和灵活性。三个 fail-closed 条件对应了规格文档最常见的三类事故根源。strict 模式的 Profile 装配确保高风险领域不会被 compat 的宽松性拖累。"
  }
]
